236edf7a003cb3ca26286aca6c585","path":"source/basic-cli.oracle.json"},{"digest":"sha256:ce602ce2cc0fcefaba288623a675a770d11bc14d224b90045aebbe031330172f","path":"source/original-basic-cli.txt"},{"digest":"sha256:f97359de0fe6181e44c334496993b20b82b49cdbbf0b8b66ee18de7eac34a63b","path":"source/witness-contract.md"},{"digest":"sha256:8b55bf3f6324da565a1de9a5186444e36c43f450484463aafc84b65fd9da4613","path":"test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs"},{"digest":"sha256:5449c227c7173bb1b812e46e06d3341b1624e832a2a74105f9a109ee201134d4","path":"test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs"}],"kind":"native","producerActorRef":null,"producerResultRef":null,"resultDigest":"sha256:e897db2208fad8afe99c5a184cddd24cb96421de5bb7df496a193774769cc41c","resultRef":"result://abiogenesis/e897db2208fad8afe99c5a184cddd24cb96421de5bb7df496a193774769cc41c"},"purpose":"construction","resultDigest":"sha256:e897db2208fad8afe99c5a184cddd24cb96421de5bb7df496a193774769cc41c","resultRef":"result://abiogenesis/e897db2208fad8afe99c5a184cddd24cb96421de5bb7df496a193774769cc41c","selectedGraphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/construction@5","synthesisResultRef":"result://abiogenesis/3967846950f8541f65b2ed43747537d5f0acce0f5f31bca5d8bc4fa2561d8612","value":{"changedPaths":["generated/hello-world.mjs"],"report":{"gaps":["specification/project-conformance.md does not exist; writing it is outside this grant's write territory. Obligation conformance@5 is still open.","design/implementation-design.md does not exist; writing it is outside this grant's write territory. Obligation implementation-design@5 is still open.","design/test-design.md does not exist; writing it is outside this grant's write territory. Obligation test-design@5 is still open.","test-execution-plan.json does not exist; writing it is outside this grant's write territory. Obligation execution-plan@5 is still open.","The passing run on the corrected CLI (sha256:fe8f4080...) is only my own check, not recorded evidence. Obligations behavior@5 and revision@5 each need a new recorded run of both fixed commands against these bytes, linked to the earlier failing run (result 6514754a...).","No independent semantic assessment has been done by a different actor/call. complete-original@5 and every other parent obligation stay open until that assessment and the required evidence roles exist."],"summary":"Made one bounded fix to the CLI, justified by the recorded baseline run. That run (dependency sha256:647697a5..., the same bytes that were in place before the edit) showed `node generated/hello-world.mjs` exits 0 but prints \"Hello world!\\n\" (13 bytes, no comma). Both supplied tests then failed (0 pass, 2 fail, exit 1): each asserts stdout === \"Hello, world!\\n\". Edited only generated/hello-world.mjs: `console.log(\"Hello world!\");` became `console.log(\"Hello, world!\");` (new sha256:fe8f40803a256b5b65c97f5f4cae862fd55b37cb81f2a803c56c3f654c22e9ef). console.log adds exactly one \"\\n\", Node needs no packages, and nothing else changed. My own check afterwards, run with in-memory pipes and no files created: `node generated/hello-world.mjs` gives stdout \"Hello, world!\\n\" and exit 0. `node --test test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs` gives tests 2, pass 2, fail 0, exit 0. The digests of source/original-basic-cli.txt (ce602ce2...), source/basic-cli.oracle.json (028073e4...), source/witness-contract.md (f97359de...), test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs (8b55bf3f...) and test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs (5449c227...) all match their recorded values. The baseline failure still applies to the old bytes (647697a5...) and is the recorded reason for this fix. It should not be treated as describing the corrected file. My check is not recorded evidence and not an independent acceptance. No writes outside generated/hello-world.mjs."}}},{"actorInvocationRef":"actor-invocation://abiogenesis/17b6beb2abf3e9feacd9c36d77cfef3c4ff2f3fdeac7c9fd4dfc80b7a69cbfdc","cCallRef":"c-call:sha256:71913042