cation/project-conformance.md"},{"digest":"sha256:e940dcf297eab1d9eafe127b93f56a6b43e0133a0015fee8b1a02818c5e4def3","path":"test-execution-plan.json"},{"digest":"sha256:8b55bf3f6324da565a1de9a5186444e36c43f450484463aafc84b65fd9da4613","path":"test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs"},{"digest":"sha256:5449c227c7173bb1b812e46e06d3341b1624e832a2a74105f9a109ee201134d4","path":"test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs"}],"kind":"assessment","producerActorRef":"actor-invocation://abiogenesis/17b6beb2abf3e9feacd9c36d77cfef3c4ff2f3fdeac7c9fd4dfc80b7a69cbfdc","producerResultRef":"result://abiogenesis/db34d3cf4111de970877f4698262cc2802f4878a7e5ada89145a02c7abf0e4c4","resultDigest":"sha256:8339edb09a1e9ba184fe01e5784317fd8cde4043b64ffcc7ece50c7b09e2083a","resultRef":"result://abiogenesis/8339edb09a1e9ba184fe01e5784317fd8cde4043b64ffcc7ece50c7b09e2083a"},"purpose":"uat","resultDigest":"sha256:8339edb09a1e9ba184fe01e5784317fd8cde4043b64ffcc7ece50c7b09e2083a","resultRef":"result://abiogenesis/8339edb09a1e9ba184fe01e5784317fd8cde4043b64ffcc7ece50c7b09e2083a","selectedGraphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","synthesisResultRef":"result://abiogenesis/33aa0802b8be1d7e49b544b054ed8da3d1cd105dd3a24958840a3a756816b65a","value":{"disposition":"satisfied","fulfillment":{"discoveries":[{"classRef":"discovery://default-library-witness/source-obligations@5","evidenceRefs":["result://abiogenesis/db34d3cf4111de970877f4698262cc2802f4878a7e5ada89145a02c7abf0e4c4","result://abiogenesis/6514754aa979c64827c955c618e60ece86ef79274b734c3844f2a13243a95d5c","result://abiogenesis/33db8d198f2a1114256e2cda6fb6ed740af20bc95de2a7c8bb44ee1dcff12b08","result://abiogenesis/4fbf98755483b8f9bf0f6bc34c0646ccc367ce1fb55fe6c30824c3096b4c2b2b","result://abiogenesis/e897db2208fad8afe99c5a184cddd24cb96421de5bb7df496a193774769cc41c"],"judgment":"satisfied","reason":"I found no uncovered source obligation.\n- Every original stage meaning (conformance_project … test_execution_result) and every oracle field maps to one of the seven declared obligations.\n- The handwritten test-execution-result.json meaning is covered under complete-original through admitted C2 evidence plus this assessment, as the witness contract selects.\n- The supplied component and UAT test stages are covered as reused verifier artifacts.\n\nObserved residuals are not source-required and are recorded, not proposed as new requirements: Node version unrecorded, single-platform evidence, unconstrained stderr, and identical UAT/component mechanics."}],"obligations":[{"adverseEvidenceRefs":[],"criteria":[{"criterionRef":"criterion://default-library-witness/complete-original@5","judgment":"satisfied","reason":"All eight original stage meanings and all oracle fields are met on current bytes. Behavior comes from admitted C2 evidence, not from author reports. The original acceptance rule (exit 0 ∧ observedTestPassCount ≥ expectedTestPassCount ∧ planSatisfied) evaluates true over db34d3cf and plan e940dcf2. No original obligation was dropped: test-execution-result.json's meaning is carried by C2 plus this assessment, as the witness contract and oracle require."}],"depth":[{"classRef":"depth://default-library-witness/complete-original@5","evidenceRefs":["result://abiogenesis/db34d3cf4111de970877f4698262cc2802f4878a7e5ada89145a02c7abf0e4c4","result://abiogenesis/6514754aa979c64827c955c618e60ece86ef79274b734c3844f2a13243a95d5c","result://abiogenesis/33db8d198f2a1114256e2cda6fb6ed740af20bc95de2a7c8bb44ee1dcff12b08","result://abiogenesis/4fbf98755483b8f9bf0f6bc34c0646ccc367ce1fb55fe6c30824c3096b4c2b2b","result://abiogenesis/e897db2208fad8afe99c5a184cddd24cb96421de5bb7df496a193774769cc41c"],"judgment":"satisfied","reason":"I assessed at content depth rather than file presence:\n- recomputed all ten file digests, the expected stdout digest and the pre-correction CLI digest;\n- read each authored asset against the original stage instructions and oracle fields;\n- read both test sources for real-process execution and strict assertions;\n- confirmed verifier discrimination from the admitted baseline, where both tests failed on the comma defect;\n- evaluated the plan predicates against the current C2 stdout.\n\nResiduals kept: Node version unrecorded; single macOS host; stderr unconstrained; UAT and component tests identical in mechanics."}],"judgment":"satisfied","obligationRef":"obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5","policyRef":"proof-policy://default-library-witness/complete-original@5","reason":"Every original stage meaning is realized on the current subject.\n- conformance_project, implementation_design and test_design: substantive fresh assets (see their obligations).\n- source: current CLI fe8f4080 prints exactly \"Hello, world!\\n\" and exits 0 with no package installation (admitted C2 db34d3cf, command 0).\n- component_test_source and uat_test_source: supplied, unchanged and reused. Both use node:test, node:assert/strict and spawnSync on process.execPath with ['generated/hello-world.mjs'] from the inherited project-root cwd, asserting status 0 and exact stdout.\n- test_execution_plan: plan fields exact.\n- test_execution_result: accept predicate holds over db34d3cf command 1 (exit 0, pass 2 ≥ 2, planSatisfied true).\n\nOracle checks: cases[0] (no arguments, exact stdout, exit 0) is matched; minimumTestPasses 2 is met, with one pass from each required test file; all seven requiredArtifacts are present with substantive content.\n\nThe honest execution-result meaning is preserved through admitted C2 evidence rather than a handwritten receipt, as the witness contract selects. Protected inputs are digest-unchanged.","shapeRef":"proof-shape://default-library-witness/complete-original@5","support":[{"artifactPath":"generated/hello-world.mjs","commandId":null,"resultRef":"result://abiogenesis/db34d3cf4111de970877f4698262cc2802f4878a7e5ada89145a02c7abf0e4c4","role":"realization"},{"artifactPath":"test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs","commandId":null,"resultRef