d58f1e469671fcd9cdef","environmentRef":"environment://default-library-witness/selected@5","frameEvidenceDigest":"sha256:9a5490d7d8c1ddada28051ec3bf6f00a3a706769e98fb9752bfff33d3f26ba52","frameRefs":["stdo://releases/v2.5.1-rc.1/standards/STDO_REFERENCE_FRAME_BASELINE.md#derived-executive-frame"],"inputDigest":"sha256:0412c1b204f5782bf8162dc584e4d21e3e075723017c0dcf1873a08cfa808f59","inputRef":"result://abiogenesis/1f170b3fde3a65f8fc5759ed1026669bd94efa3a65928ae53db858b7d1e14d4e","previousResultRef":"result://abiogenesis/3ee588afbda63abb5d1406c30202aad127111ab61e4c2b217f8ec91a194d092d","taskRef":"task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5"},"judgment":{"contributions":[{"contribution":"Read-only independent assessment of the complete original outcome. Use the complete original source, the oracle rubric `source/basic-cli.oracle.json`, the witness contract and the exact current candidate `generated/hello-world.mjs` (fe8f4080…). Subject: current C2 measurement db34d3cf. Assess every obligation separately, and preserve every unmet or indeterminate criterion.\n\n1. conformance: `specification/project-conformance.md` (9d02e5fb…, from 33db8d19). Check that its content is substantive and matches the conformance_project stage:\n- It declares a minimal CLI Hello World build traversal.\n- The source surface is `generated/hello-world.mjs`.\n- The execution proof runs the CLI and observes stdout exactly `Hello, world!\\n`.\n- It covers Intent, Product boundary, requirements and completion criteria.\n- Conflicts C-1..C-7 and unknowns U-1..U-6 are handled honestly.\n\n2. implementation-design: `design/implementation-design.md` (3cacf757…). Check that it:\n- uses the conformance asset as authority;\n- defines a minimal Node CLI at `generated/hello-world.mjs` that prints exactly `Hello, world!` followed by one newline, needs no package installation and exits 0;\n- names the component and UAT test surfaces that execute the CLI and assert stdout;\n- is realizable against the actual current CLI.\n\n3. test-design: `design/test-design.md` (1995fa7e…). Check that it specifies component and UAT validation in which both tests spawn `node generated/hello-world.mjs` and assert status 0 and stdout exactly `Hello, world!\\n`, and that it matches the actual supplied tests.\n\n4. execution-plan: `test-execution-plan.json` (e940dcf2…). Check:\n- `command` is `\"node\"`.\n- `args` is exactly `[\"--test\",\"test/component/hello-cli.test.mjs\",\"test/uat/hello-cli.uat.test.mjs\"]`.\n- `expectedTestPassCount` is at least 2.\n- `expectedStdoutMatch` includes stable zero-failure evidence such as `fail 0`, with no pinned pass-count fragment.\n- `assertedReturnValue` is `\"Hello, world!\"`.\n- It agrees with fixed commands 0 and 1.\n- It is prospective: it does not control execution and contains no fabricated observed results.\n- Its extra fields (direct CLI check, hashes, history, acceptance rule) do not contradict the original.\n\n5. Verifier adequacy. Check that both supplied tests:\n- use `node:test`, `node:assert/strict` and `spawnSync`;\n- run `process.execPath` with `['generated/hello-world.mjs']` from the project root;\n- assert status 0 and exact stdout.\nBaseline 6514754a shows they detect the missing comma. Judge whether the UAT test, which uses the same mechanics as the component test, still meets the uat_test_source meaning: it must assert the user-visible output exactly.\n\n6. behavior: current C2 db34d3cf. Check:\n- Command 0 exited 0 with stdout exactly `Hello, world!\\n` (14 bytes, digest d9014c46…) and empty stderr.\n- Command 1 exited 0 with tests 2, pass 2, fail 0, and one named pass per file.\n- Apply the original test_execution_result rule: the command exited 0, observed passes are at least the plan's expectedTestPassCount, and the plan is satisfied.\n- Judge whether admitted C2 evidence (command, args, declared environment and cwd, exit status, stdout/stderr) is enough to carry the meaning of the original handwritten `test-execution-result.json`, per C-1 and the oracle's assessment statement.\n\n7. revision. Check the chain:\n- the baseline failure 6514754a is on bytes 647697a5, before any CLI change, and stays historical, neither retargeted nor discarded;\n- a changed registered choice, construction e897db22, made a bounded one-line correction;\n- re-measurement db34d3cf ran on the corrected bytes fe8f4080 in the same lineage.\n\n8. complete-original. Check:\n- Every original stage meaning is realized or legitimately carried by the declared mechanism.\n- Application writes stay within the CLI and the four asset paths. The created `specification/` and `design/` parent folders were disclosed.\n- Protected sources are unchanged.\n- There is no package or network dependency.\n\nPreserve the residual unknowns as indeterminate where they matter: Node version not recorded, stderr unconstrained, other arguments and working directories unspecified, one host only. Do not certify from author reports, file presence or stage counts. The actor/call must be distinct from the authors (33db8d19, e897db22, 4fbf9875) and from the measurement producer (db34d3cf). Write nothing.","dependsOn":[],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/50521f4b9ce56f8bbd62f0d849c15b83f57a2f7ee13140d83684ec581fa3a054","result://abiogenesis/db34d3cf4111de970877f4698262cc2802f4878a7e5ada89145a02c7abf0e4c4","result://abiogenesis/6514754aa979c64827c955c618e60ece86ef79274b734c3844f2a13243a95d5c","result://abiogenesis/e897db2208fad8afe99c5a184cddd24cb96421de5bb7df496a193774769cc41c","result://abiogenesis/33db8d198f2a1114256e2cda6fb6ed740af20bc95de2a7c8bb44ee1dcff12b08","result://abiogenesis/4fbf98755483b8f9bf0f6bc34c0646ccc367ce1fb55fe6c30824c3096b4c2b2b"],"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","reason":"Parent completion requires an independent semantic assessment of exact current evidence for all seven obligations. The prerequisites for that now exist:\n- The four authored assets exist and are current (50521f4b).\n- The corrected CLI and the verifiers are unchanged, so C2 db34d3cf is current execution evidence on the exact candidate.\n- Baseline 6514754a and correction e897db22 establish the revision lineage.\n\nNo further authoring or re-measurement is needed first. Specification, construction, testing and design are completed work, cited as evidence, not as dependencies.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5","obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5","obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5","obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5","obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5"]}],"gaps":[],"interpretation":"The prior judgment (3ee588af) chose design. It ran as native work 4fbf9875 and wrote only its three permitted files. Worksite observation 50521f4b shows all three are current, with byte identities that match the author's report:\n- `design/implementation-design.md` (3cacf757…)\n- `design/test-design.md` (1995fa7e…)\n- `test-execution-plan.json` (e940dcf2…)\n\nThat run's only side effect was creating the `design/` folder, which it disclosed. Together with `specification/project-conformance.md` (9d02e5fb…, from 33db8d19), all four authored assets now exist and are current. None of the protected files changed: the original source (ce602ce2…), the oracle (028073e4…), the witness contract (f97359de…) and both tests (8b55bf3f…, 5449c227…) keep their declared digests.\n\nThe CLI is still fe8f4080…, and design did not touch it or the verifiers. So the C2 measurement db34d3cf is still current evidence on the corrected subject:\n- `node generated/hello-world.mjs` exited 0, printed exactly `Hello, world!\\n` (14 bytes) and wrote nothing to stderr.\n- `node --test …` exited 0 with 2 passes and 0 failures, one named pass from each test file.\n\nBaseline C2 6514754a stays historical evidence about the earlier bytes 647697a5. On those bytes the CLI printed `Hello world!\\n`, and the tests exited 1 with 0 passes and 2 failures. Its staleness applies only to the old CLI, and it remains the reason for the bounded one-line correction e897db22 in the same lineage.\n\nThe reports from specification, design and construction are the authors' own accounts, not adequacy judgments. Every required realization, verifier-artifact and verifier-execution role now has actual current support. No further authoring or measurement is needed before assessment, and the steel thread plus the authored assets are complete enough to qualify. All seven obligations stay open because each one still needs an independent semantic assessment.\n\nIssues the assessment must weigh rather than assume, as disclosed by the authors:\n- The UAT test uses the same mechanics as the component test.\n- The Node version is not recorded (U-1).\n- stderr, arguments and working directory are unconstrained or unspecified.\n- Only one host has been evidenced.\n- C-1 replaces the handwritten `test-execution-result.json` with admitted C2 evidence.\n- The execution plan contains extra fields beyond those the original requires.","nextEvidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/50521f4b9ce56f8bbd62f0d849c15b83f57a2f7ee13140d83684ec581fa3a054","result://abiogenesis/db34d3cf4111de970877f4698262cc2802f4878a7e5ada89145a02c7abf0e4c4","result://abiogenesis/6514754aa979c64827c955c618e60ece86ef79274b734c3844f2a13243a95d5c","result://abiogenesis/e897db2208fad8afe99c5a184cddd24cb96421de5bb7df496a193774769cc41c","result://abiogenesis/33db8d198f2a1114256e2cda6fb6ed740af20bc95de2a7c8bb44ee1dcff12b08","result://abiogenesis/4fbf98755483b8f9bf0f6bc34c0646ccc367ce1fb55fe6c30824c3096b4c2b2b"],"nextGraphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","nextReason":"UAT runs next because it is the only remaining step that can close the obligations. All realization and verifier roles have current support: the four authored assets (33db8d19, 4fbf9875), the corrected CLI (e897db22) and the C2 execution evidence on it (db34d3cf), linked to the historical baseline 6514754a.\n\nSubject: db34d3cf. It is the current C2 measurement of the exact candidate `generated/hello-world.mjs` (fe8f4080…), with both fixed commands, and all its support files are current. The UAT work order already reads the four authored assets directly. Selecting a measurement is a choice of observation provenance, not authorship.","requirementProposals":[],"revisionEvidenceRefs":["result://abiogenesis/3ee588afbda63abb5d1406c30202aad127111ab61e4c2b217f8ec91a194d092d","result://abiogenesis/4fbf98755483b8f9bf0f6bc34c0646ccc367ce1fb55fe6c30824c3096b4c2b2b","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/50521f4b9ce56f8bbd62f0d849c15b83f57a2f7ee13140d83684ec581fa3a054","result://abiogenesis/33db8d198f2a1114256e2cda6fb6ed740af20bc95de2a7c8bb44ee1dcff12b08","result://abiogenesis/db34d3cf4111de970877f4698262cc2802f4878a7e5ada89145a02c7abf0e4c4","result://abiogenesis/e897db2208fad8afe99c5a184cddd24cb96421de5bb7df496a193774769cc41c","result://abiogenesis/6514754aa979c64827c955c618e60ece86ef79274b734c3844f2a13243a95d5c"],"revisionReason":"The prior judgment (3ee588af) chose design next. It ran as native work 4fbf9875 and wrote only `design/implementation-design.md`, `design/test-design.md` and `test-execution-plan.json`. Observation 50521f4b shows all three are current. Its realization role is fulfilled, so the design row is removed from the mapping. Its result is now cited as evidence and is not rerun.\n\nUAT therefore no longer depends on design. Its evidence now includes 4fbf9875 and the new worksite observation 50521f4b, which replaces 5c740741. Its subject is set to the current C2 measurement db34d3cf. That measurement is still current because design did not change the CLI or the verifiers, so no re-measurement is needed.\n\nThe rest carries over unchanged:\n- Specification 33db8d19, construction e897db22 and testing db34d3cf are reused current evidence.\n- Baseline 6514754a is still historical evidence about the earlier bytes.\n- The disclosed issues from design (identical test mechanics, Node version unknown, C-1 substitution) go to UAT to judge.\n\nThe next member moves from design to UAT.","subjectEvidenceRef":"result://abiogenesis/db34d3cf4111de970877f4698262cc2802f4878a7e5ada89145a02c7abf0e4c4"},"resultDigest":"sha256:33aa0802b8be1d7e49b544b054ed8da3d1cd105dd3a24958840a3a756816b65a","resultRef":"result://abiogenesis/33aa0802b8be1d7e49b544b054ed8da3d1cd105dd3a24958840a3a756816b65a"},"terminal":true,"unresolvedSupportRefs":[]},"valueDigest":"sha256:c1bde7f6b39332c9c43326dc35960d01fb143c49527ea63f13d91e28fef31d01","valueKind":"governance_work_state"}}},"resources":{"eventResource":{"acquisitionKind":"reopen","closeHandoff":{"prefix":{"coordinateDigest":"sha256:e04495f4f0108549f6c030a6d89e44f9ddb9a65543c9471c49dfd0dcc5fe9c10","eventLogRef":"file:///private/var/folders/rz/r6wxvr0n15d906k2s0jw8j2h0000gn/T/abi5-root-env-73tWaC/runtime/events.jsonl","kind":"durable_prefix_coordinate","prefixDigest":"sha256:3e4500b71d8124701cd1bfd76f375a431af3e7e80c8595ffe59cf57323e69280","prefixLength":99536719,"schemaVersion":"5.0.0","storeIdentity":{"device":16777230,"eventContractDigest":"sha256:ddc961a2484be150193fa255d7dc7b933e52fb81b7b2c681f2bb97e1f9d5754c","inode":463118141}},"reopenAuthority":{"authorityDigest":"sha256:4fb83848dd179861cc99e8e0ab5b46b78cdf8db5f56ffba5e830336c189f595e","device":16777230,"durableByteLength":99536719,"eventContractDigest":"sha256:ddc961a2484be150193fa255d7dc7b933e52fb81b7b2c681f2bb97e1f9d5754c","eventLogDigest":"sha256:3e4500b71d8124701cd1bfd76f375a431af3e7e80c8595ffe59cf57323e69280","eventLogPath":"/private/var/folders/rz/r6wxvr0n15d906k2s0jw8j2h0000gn/T/abi5-root-env-73tWaC/runtime/events.jsonl","inode":463118141,"kind":"event_store_reo